<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea crude oil run rises 17.4 pct in Aug yr/yr.</title>
<headline>S.Korea crude oil run rises 17.4 pct in Aug yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's crude oil processing rose 17.4 percent to 63.69 million barrels in August 1996 from 54.26 million barrels in August 1995, the Korea Petroleum Association (KPA) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>South Korean refiners' licensed crude processing capacity stood at 2.02 million barrels per day (bpd) in August versus 1.82 million bpd a year ago.</p>
<p>(In million barrels unless stated)</p>
<p>			 Aug	 July	  Aug 95	Jan-Aug</p>
<p> Crude Runs	  63.69     60.53	 54.26	 456.51</p>
<p> Util. Rate(%)    101.81     96.76	 96.28	  95.03</p>
<p> Inventory	   10.93     10.11	  7.47	  10.93</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
